R Developers Shalom
In the UseR conference that took place last week, a new visual debugger for eclipse was presented. Although R always has built-in debugging capabilities, I find this news rather exciting.
If you feel comfortable compiling R from source, the debugger is already available (drop me a note if you want some help). Otherwise, you can expect it in the upcoming weeks.

It should also be mentioned, that the Revolution Analytics IDE does already have a visual debugger for Windows for a while now. But it is not free...

J

